---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="CODERMAN" description="Software Developer, AI software development, and technical writing.">
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Software Developer</p>
    <h1>CODERMAN</h1>
    <p class="lead">AI 软件开发，Building things with code.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button primary" href="/blog/">阅读博客</a>
      <a class="button" href="#contact">联系我</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-grid" aria-labelledby="focus-title">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Focus</p>
      <h2 id="focus-title">技术方向</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="text-block">
      <p>关注软件工程、AI 辅助开发、工具链和个人知识管理。这里会整理项目经验、技术笔记和实践记录。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-grid" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
      <h2 id="contact-title">保持联系</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-panel">
      <div class="contact-links" aria-label="联系方式列表">
        <a href="mailto:2217011466@qq.com">
          <span>邮箱</span>
          <strong>2217011466@qq.com</strong>
        </a>
        <a href="https://github.com/coderManFans" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
          <span>GitHub</span>
          <strong>github.com/coderManFans</strong>
        </a>
        <a href="https://gitee.com/codergit.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
          <span>Gitee</span>
          <strong>gitee.com/codergit.com</strong>
        </a>
      </div>
      <figure class="wechat-card">
        <img src="/images/wechat-official-account.jpg" alt="微信公众号神帅的技术圈二维码" width="220" height="220" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption>
          <span>微信公众号</span>
          <strong>神帅的技术圈</strong>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
